<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuoni sees positive 1997 results.</title>
<headline>Kuoni sees positive 1997 results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss travel group Kuoni Reisen AG said it expected positive results in 1997 after a good year in 1996 and a solid start in the first quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;Results above expectations were achieved in the outgoing year of 1996, which provides a very good starting point for the current year,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The Kuoni group expects positive developments in 1997 as well, and the first quarter was gratifying,&quot; it said without elaborating.</p>
<p>It said it would give more details at a news conference on April 29. -- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
